      ver un elenco más completo en J. Chaine, o.c. p. 
      232-235- — 9 Cf. 3 Jn 3 = 1 Jn i,6s; 2:11; 3 Jn 1:7 11 = 1 Jn 3:6.10.18. — 
      10 Cf. 2 Jn 2 =&lt;= Jn 5:38; 6:56; 8:31; 15:4-10; 2 Jn 4 = Jn 8:12; 12:35; 
      10:18; 2 Jn 5 = Jn 13:34; 2 Jn 6 = Jn 15:12; 2 Jn 12 = Jn 16:24; 3 Jn 4 = 
      Jn 15:13; 3 Jn 11 = Jn 14.95 3 Jn 12 = Jn 8:14. — 11 J. Chaine, o.c. 
      p.235. — 12 Cf.Ad Philip. 7:1. — 13 <i>Adv. haer. </i>1:16.3; 3,16:8:.P,G 
      7:633.927. — 14 <i>Stromata </i>2:16:76: PG 8:1003. — 15<i> In loannem </i>
